{
  "$schema": "Tool calls for CVE-2026-117558 (ai-sdlc plugin MCP server through 0.31.2, CWE-78). `check_issue` and `check_pr_status` are the server's two tools that put `repo` into `gh issue view` / `gh pr view` through execSync; `number` is a placeholder name for their second argument. Each `payloads` entry is one call whose `repo` carries one shell token, with the argument, token and verdict ToolArgSinkGuard reports. Every value is an inert string: `id` is never run and no test spawns a process. `benign` holds calls the guard must run; `passes_by_design` holds values the guard's documented scope admits.",
